<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Telekom ADRs issued at $18.89.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Telekom ADRs issued at $18.89.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Depository Receipts (ADRs) issued by Deutsche Telekom AG in Europe's largest ever stock listing will be priced at $18.89 marks each, Telekom's chief financial officer Joachim Kroeske said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Earlier, Telekom said its issue of 713 million marks, which was oversubscribed at least five times, would be issued at a price of 28.50 marks each.</p>
<p>--William Boston, Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
